%description:
Test connection setup: A performs active open, and its first five SYNs get
lost.
Test that:
- initial RTO is 3s
- it doubles with each retransmission
- the open goes on after 75 s, as RFC 9293 section 3.8.3 asks for at least
  3 minutes of SYN retransmissions (MUST-23): the sixth SYN, at t=93 s, gets
  through, and the connection opens

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

#cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s

# delete SYN segments to force their retransmission
*.tcptester.script="a1 delete;a2 delete;a3 delete;a4 delete;a5 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
cli_tcp: INIT --> SYN_SENT  (on OPEN_ACTIVE)
srv_tcp: INIT --> LISTEN  (on OPEN_PASSIVE)
[0.001 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[3.001 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[9.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[21.001 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[45.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize# deleting
[93.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: S 0:0(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[93.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 23250500:23250500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[93.005 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 23250501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[93.006] tcpdump finished, A:7 B:1 segments
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
[93.006] tcpdump finished, A:7 B:1 segments

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
